  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Our grant promised new insights into gene regulation during neural stem cell differentiation, and now I have to deliver something. We have expression for 24 samples across the time course, a TF motif prior and a PPI table."
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Routing matched these registered workflows to your words, but the capability check did not confirm that any of them gives what you asked for:\n- **PANDA** — produces: One weighted TF-to-gene regulatory network across all the samples given.\n- **LIONESS-PANDA** — produces: One TF-gene network per sample, plus the aggregate network.\n- **OTTER** — produces: One weighted TF-to-gene regulatory network across all samples, fitted so that it agrees with the PPI network and gene co-expression.\n- **GIRAFFE** — produces: A signed TF-to-gene regulatory matrix (positive activating, negative repressing), across all samples. Each TF's activity in each sample, estimated apart from its own mRNA level.\n\nCompare what each produces with what you asked for. Ask again to re-run the check, or say which result you want and from which workflow.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
    }
  ],
